      "label": "Management",
      "content": "<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Officers</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Stephen%20Roman\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Stephen Roman</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">December 2017</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chairman, President and Chief Executive Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Roman is an entrepreneur who has successfully identified, financed, developed, and operated several mining and oil and gas projects. He was formerly the Chairman, President and CEO of Gold Eagle Mines Ltd. and Harte Gold Corp.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Rein%20Lehari\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Rein Lehari</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">December 2017</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chief Financial Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Lehari is a Chartered Professional Accountant and was formerly a partner with PricewaterhouseCoopers LLP. He has over 30 years of experience in the mining industry.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Ronald%20Halas\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Ronald Halas</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">October 2020</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chief Operating Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Halas is a Professional Engineer with over 30 years of experience in the mining industry, including roles at IAMGOLD, Kinross Gold, and Vale.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Fergus%20Kerr\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Fergus Kerr</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">December 2017</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Vice President, Operations</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Kerr is a Professional Engineer with over 40 years of experience in the mining industry, specializing in underground mining operations.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Bob%20Partridge\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Bob Partridge</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">December 2017</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Vice President, Exploration</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Partridge is a Professional Geoscientist with over 35 years of experience in mineral exploration and development.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Tim%20Campbell\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Tim Campbell</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">December 2017</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Vice President, ESG and Corporate Secretary</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Campbell has over 25 years of experience in the mining sector, focusing on corporate development, regulatory compliance, and investor relations.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Asher%20Levitsky\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Asher Levitsky</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">December 2017</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Levitsky is a lawyer with over 40 years of experience in corporate and securities law. He is a partner at Ellenoff Grossman & Schole LLP.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Derek%20Rance\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Derek Rance</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2009</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Non-Executive Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Rance is a Professional Engineer and experienced mining executive. He was formerly the President and CEO of Iron Ore Company of Canada.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Richard%20Adams\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Richard Adams</a></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Adams has over 40 years of experience in the financial services industry, specializing in investment banking and corporate finance.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Tracey%20Arlaud\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Tracey Arlaud</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">June 2021</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Ms. Arlaud is a mining engineer with over 25 years of experience in the mining industry. She is currently the CEO of I-80 Gold Corp.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Directors</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Stephen%20Roman\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Stephen Roman</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">December 2017</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chairman</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Chairman, President and CEO of Global Atomic Corporation. Extensive experience in the resource sector.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Tracey%20Arlaud\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Tracey Arlaud</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">June 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Ms. Arlaud is a mining engineer with over 25 years of experience in the mining industry. She is currently the CEO of I-80 Gold Corp.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Asher%20Levitsky\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Asher Levitsky</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">December 2017</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Levitsky is a lawyer with over 40 years of experience in corporate and securities law. He is a partner at Ellenoff Grossman & Schole LLP.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Richard%20Adams\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Richard Adams</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">December 2017</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Adams has over 40 years of experience in the financial services industry, specializing in investment banking and corporate finance.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Derek%20Rance\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Derek Rance</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">December 2017</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Rance is a Professional Engineer and experienced mining executive. He was formerly the President and CEO of Iron Ore Company of Canada.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Dean%20Chambers\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Dean Chambers</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">May 10, 2021</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Professional Engineer and financial executive with over 35 years of experience. Former CFO of Sherritt International Corporation.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sources</h2><ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.6;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://www.globalatomiccorp.com/investors/sedar-filings/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">Management Information Circular dated May 15, 2024</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-05-15)</span></li></ul>"
